 {"date": "2026-11-22", "pillar": "innovation", "href": "https://afritech-advisory.github.io/Afritech-Advisory-afritech-tournament-desk/qatar-u17-2026/egypt/#egy-qat",
  "h": L("Matchday 4: Egypt beat the hosts, Uganda earn a first point", "Journée 4 : l'Égypte bat le pays hôte, premier point pour l'Ouganda", "Siku ya 4: Misri yawafunga wenyeji, Uganda yapata pointi ya kwanza", "Rodada 4: o Egito vence os donos da casa e Uganda conquista o primeiro ponto"),
  "p": L("Egypt beat Qatar 2-0, with captain Ahmed Safwat scoring after two minutes and named Player of the Match. Uganda drew 0-0 with Ecuador, and Mozambique lost 2-1 to Argentina, with Alírio Cuna Júnior's third goal of the tournament. Match reports and players to watch on our Tournament Desk.", "L'Égypte a battu le Qatar 2-0 : le capitaine Ahmed Safwat a marqué dès la 2e minute et a été élu joueur du match. L'Ouganda a fait 0-0 contre l'Équateur, et le Mozambique s'est incliné 2-1 face à l'Argentine malgré le troisième but d'Alírio Cuna Júnior dans le tournoi. Comptes rendus et joueurs à suivre sur notre Desk Tournoi.", "Misri iliifunga Qatar 2-0: nahodha Ahmed Safwat alifunga baada ya dakika mbili na kutajwa Mchezaji Bora wa Mechi. Uganda ilitoka sare ya 0-0 na Ecuador, na Msumbiji ilipoteza 2-1 dhidi ya Argentina licha ya bao la tatu la Alírio Cuna Júnior kwenye mashindano. Ripoti za mechi na wachezaji wa kufuatilia kwenye Dawati letu la Mashindano.", "O Egito venceu o Catar por 2 a 0: o capitão Ahmed Safwat marcou aos dois minutos e foi eleito o melhor em campo. Uganda empatou por 0 a 0 com o Equador, e Moçambique perdeu por 2 a 1 para a Argentina, com o terceiro gol de Alírio Cuna Júnior no torneio. Relatórios dos jogos e jogadores para acompanhar na nossa Mesa do Torneio.")},
 {"date": "2026-11-21", "pillar": "innovation", "href": "https://afritech-advisory.github.io/Afritech-Advisory-afritech-tournament-desk/qatar-u17-2026/tanzania/#tan-crc",
  "h": L("Matchday 3: Tanzania fight back on their World Cup debut", "Journée 3 : la Tanzanie revient au score pour ses débuts en Coupe du monde", "Siku ya 3: Tanzania warudi kutoka nyuma katika mechi yao ya kwanza ya Kombe la Dunia", "Rodada 3: a Tanzânia busca o empate na estreia em Copas"),
  "p": L("Two down after 15 minutes, Tanzania drew 2-2 with Costa Rica: Faraji Kayanda scored twice and was Player of the Match. Algeria led Chile 2-0 before losing 4-2, and Cameroon lost 2-1 to Venezuela. Match reports and players to watch on our Tournament Desk.", "Menée 2-0 après un quart d'heure, la Tanzanie a arraché le 2-2 contre le Costa Rica : Faraji Kayanda a marqué deux fois et a été élu joueur du match. L'Algérie menait 2-0 contre le Chili avant de s'incliner 4-2, et le Cameroun a perdu 2-1 face au Venezuela. Comptes rendus et joueurs à suivre sur notre Desk Tournoi.", "Wakiwa nyuma 2-0 baada ya dakika 15, Tanzania walitoka sare ya 2-2 na Costa Rica: Faraji Kayanda alifunga mara mbili na kuwa Mchezaji Bora wa Mechi. Algeria iliongoza 2-0 dhidi ya Chile kabla ya kupoteza 4-2, na Cameroon ilipoteza 2-1 dhidi ya Venezuela. Ripoti za mechi na wachezaji wa kufuatilia kwenye Dawati letu la Mashindano.", "Perdendo por 2 a 0 aos 15 minutos, a Tanzânia empatou por 2 a 2 com a Costa Rica: Faraji Kayanda marcou duas vezes e foi o melhor em campo. A Argélia vencia o Chile por 2 a 0, mas perdeu por 4 a 2, e Camarões perdeu para a Venezuela por 2 a 1. Relatórios dos jogos e jogadores para acompanhar na nossa Mesa do Torneio.")},
 {"date": "2026-11-20", "pillar": "innovation", "href": "https://afritech-advisory.github.io/Afritech-Advisory-afritech-tournament-desk/qatar-u17-2026/cote-divoire/#civ-uzb",
  "h": L("Matchday 2: a late winner for Côte d'Ivoire, big wins for Morocco and Mali", "Journée 2 : victoire au bout du suspense pour la Côte d'Ivoire, larges succès du Maroc et du Mali", "Siku ya 2: Bao la dakika za mwisho kwa Côte d'Ivoire, ushindi mkubwa kwa Morocco na Mali", "Rodada 2: vitória no fim para a Costa do Marfim e goleadas de Marrocos e Mali"),
  "p": L("Substitute Abass Luc Diarrassouba won it 2-1 for Côte d'Ivoire against Uzbekistan in the 88th minute. Morocco beat Fiji 6-0, Mali beat New Zealand 3-0, and ten-man Senegal drew 1-1 with Croatia. Match reports and players to watch on our Tournament Desk.", "Entré en jeu, Abass Luc Diarrassouba a offert la victoire 2-1 à la Côte d'Ivoire contre l'Ouzbékistan à la 88e minute. Le Maroc a battu les Fidji 6-0, le Mali la Nouvelle-Zélande 3-0, et le Sénégal, à dix, a fait 1-1 contre la Croatie. Comptes rendus et joueurs à suivre sur notre Desk Tournoi.", "Mchezaji wa akiba Abass Luc Diarrassouba aliipa Côte d'Ivoire ushindi wa 2-1 dhidi ya Uzbekistan dakika ya 88. Morocco iliifunga Fiji 6-0, Mali iliifunga New Zealand 3-0, na Senegal wakiwa pungufu walitoka sare ya 1-1 na Croatia. Ripoti za mechi na wachezaji wa kufuatilia kwenye Dawati letu la Mashindano.", "O reserva Abass Luc Diarrassouba deu a vitória por 2 a 1 à Costa do Marfim sobre o Uzbequistão aos 88 minutos. Marrocos fez 6 a 0 em Fiji, o Mali venceu a Nova Zelândia por 3 a 0, e o Senegal, com dez, empatou por 1 a 1 com a Croácia. Relatórios dos jogos e jogadores para acompanhar na nossa Mesa do Torneio.")},
